# .dockerignore
# =============================================================================
# The Dockerfile copies an explicit file list, which is not the same thing as a
# small build context. Without this file the daemon was sent everything in the
# checkout: measured at 1.23 GB (assets 753 MB, .git 372 MB, the rest tests,
# docs and local config). With it, initially 754 MB. Issue #25 then removed
# unused pre-rendered artwork and linked duplicate placeholders, leaving about
# 4 MiB of assets. Do not ignore the shared masters: the venue links need them.
#
# Keep this in sync with Dockerfile COPY lines: ignoring something the image
# needs produces a confusing "not found" at build time rather than here.

# --- version control ---------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- editor tracks and dead ends --------------------------------------------
*.backup
*.backup*
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- historical notes --------------------------------------------------------
# Kept in git for their design rationale; of no use inside the image.
aicontextual_notes

# --- documentation -----------------------------------------------------------
*.md
docs

# --- tests and developer scratch scripts ------------------------------------
# Nothing here belongs in a runtime image. scripts/ in particular contains a
# utility that DELETES media; it must never be reachable from inside the
# container. The synthetic WebUI preview output is local development state too.
tests
scripts
.preview-data
test_*.py
pytest.ini
setup.cfg
tox.ini
conftest.py
htmlcov
.coverage
.pytest_cache

# --- python cruft ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info
.venv
.venv*
venv
.python-version

# --- local configuration, never baked in ------------------------------------
# Real credentials live in /config at runtime or in the container template.
.env
.env.*
config/settings.yml
config/webui_settings.json
config/grabber_state.json
config/watcher_state.json
config/activity_events.json
config/discord_rate_limit.json
config/logs
config/*.bak
*.log

# --- CI / build metadata -----------------------------------------------------
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
